<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/analytical-hillshading/actions/addition> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-10-08T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType rim:additionAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/analytical-hillshading> ;
    rim:proposer gp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/analytical-hillshading/actions/meaning-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The meaning of the operation moves to the activity type https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/activity-type/analytical-hillshading, linked by activityType (gp:activityType). The definition no longer defines the operation; it was: \"For each cell, the angle at which light coming from the position of the light source hits the terrain surface (SAGA's standard method).\"" ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/analytical-hillshading> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer gp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/analytical-hillshading/actions/representation-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The schema copied on each input and output that had one is replaced by the representation that realizes its data type in the data-formats register (decision D6): inputs/elevation -> elevation-model-geotiff (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentEncoding\": \"base64\", \"contentMediaType\": \"image/tiff\", \"description\": \"GeoTIFF\"}); outputs/result -> raster-single-band-geotiff (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentEncoding\": \"base64\", \"contentMediaType\": \"image/tiff\", \"description\": \"GeoTIFF\"})." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/analytical-hillshading> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer gp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/analytical-hillshading/actions/sections-restored-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "Corrects what https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/analytical-hillshading/actions/tools-2026-11-09 describes: the description sections removed then (sources, illustrations, data formats, multiplicity and the open question where present, and the Register position reference to the tier-4 process and its testbed URL) are restored. Tools and testbed stay in the prose; decision D4 applies to the model (keywords, source, properties), which carries none. Decision of 2026-11-09." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/analytical-hillshading> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer gp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/analytical-hillshading/actions/tools-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "Decision D4: tool keywords removed: ta_lighting; 2 format keywords removed from inputs and outputs (inputs/elevation: GeoTIFF; outputs/result: GeoTIFF); sources removed (tools, testbed, the bbox schema now in the representation's format): SAGA 7.3.0 -- Analytical Hillshading <https://saga-gis.sourceforge.io/saga_tool_doc/7.3.0/ta_lighting_0.html>; ZOO-Project Geonovum testbed -- SAGA.ta_lighting.0: Analytical Hillshading <https://host1.tb.geonovum.geolabs.fr/ogc-api/processes/SAGA.ta_lighting.0>; description rewritten without tool, host or testbed. Each removed tool or testbed reference remains findable at tier 4, in bblocks-process-profiles." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/analytical-hillshading> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer gp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/analytical-hillshading/inputs/altitude> dcterms:type <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-data-types/def/data-type/number> ;
    proc:keywords "altitude" ;
